# Auto-generated by generate_dockerfile.py for the SecBench.js benchmark.
# Entry : @eivifj/dot@1.0.3  (prototype-pollution)
# CVE   : CVE-2020-7639
# Repo  : eivindfjeldstad/dot
# Source: git clone https://github.com/eivindfjeldstad/dot @ 1.0.3 (fixed)
#
# Build context is THIS folder. Build & run with, e.g.:
